{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb87bf7f785528d2b657f1d8067f36e0ef53b467357a463b82a9919a46ec4a3b", "ja": "（新年ライブのスタートが目前に迫っている。\nメインを飾るのり子達の様子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（新年演唱会就快要开始了。\n不知道担任主角的法子她们状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "5feb319bed3f2c67970a1dda4b83922734a640d119219001af7dd832d443a51c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nこっちの準備は万端だよ。ばっちこい！って感じ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n现在是「我们已经准备好啰，尽管放马过来！」的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bbc5fc7d4d1fa04a87a741cbae53459a85098e5ac3037f57f17ebf50a7a22c6a", "ja": "おっ、のり子。気合い充分だな！", "zh": "哦，法子，你干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "75e0163008631492f222b7840291c3e288133f1ff3719f1f7b16d604024c0986", "ja": "へへ～。何しろライブの成功祈願に、\nお守り買ってきたくらいだからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿～毕竟我为了祈求演唱会成功，\n还特地买了护身符回来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1004_p", "source_sha256": "04384a0fb92868eae65ca35a976fe5863db912a69455495305513252fcf79cb7", "ja": "へえ、お守りか。\n買ってきたのは、商売繁盛……いや、必勝祈願か？", "zh": "哦，护身符啊。\n你买的是生意兴隆……不对，祈求必胜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "6d23f44711268631e18d1c49b75b65c6d6dcfa6892b66b56edc855615799014d", "ja": "え？　えっとねー……あれ、なんだっけ？\n今確認してみるよ。んーと。", "zh": "咦？记得是……嗯？我买的是什么啊？\n我现在确认一下，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "7ac7a4b89425da58b0a3d1fd0d09975ad36f1c4cdd36796ca8c30308d0a28c6a", "ja": "……ああーっ！？", "zh": "……啊──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1007_p", "source_sha256": "92bf56af19f0bc9f250683a0d085d36ee1ce806ade7743d9477ef79771d2b5d9", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ？\n急に大声を上げたりして……。", "zh": "你、你怎么了？\n突然叫得那么大声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "3dd9d2e7bba3854f20f4503289df9590cca05cbc5e5ddd9637eacfda593431f8", "ja": "これ、縁結びのお守りだった！　ど、どうしよう、\n{$P$}！　アタシ間違えたかも！？", "zh": "这是结缘的护身符啊！怎、怎么办，\n{$P$}！我是不是搞砸了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "8901891cb0f4301d82857b071725a653ea25fed4a461d6ced9d8624eb1410cf2", "ja": "アタシはライブを成功させようと思ってただけで、\n別に、そういうつもりじゃ……。", "zh": "我只是希望演唱会成功而已，\n根本没有那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae6d2a9ef01fb4ba54beb9e03a04ce69423040092354c7686173237dc952cfa9", "ja": "いやっ！？　そういうつもりっていうのは、\nそういうつもりって意味じゃなくて……ううっ。", "zh": "不对！我说那个意思，\n并不是指那个意思……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1011_p", "source_sha256": "430eeb6737fad0fc73d343e3d89a9abb074e5f8991e54d85f1d3ea7fa7763a36", "ja": "落ち着け、のり子。縁結びも悪くないんじゃないか？\nいや……むしろ、ぴったりかもしれない。", "zh": "冷静一点，法子。结缘也没什么不好的啊。\n不……说不定反倒很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "035b81435b23a82a44bc53ba73979f9a5f7490927b4779197cbb25b452076e9a", "ja": "え、ええっ！？\nでも、縁結びだよ？　ライブと全然関係ないよ？", "zh": "咦、咦咦！？\n但那是结缘耶，跟演唱会一点关系也没有吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2324bbb43d0bb7d2595e7b3b5a8af9901106c03681fb999da1e9528dde6f9800", "ja": "縁っていうのは、巡り合わせのことだからな。\n出会いのタイミング、一期一会みたいな……。", "zh": "因为所谓的缘份，就是指人与人之间的邂逅。\n像是相遇的时机、一生一次的相逢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "f408fa6468ba85add6ec3bde7cd1d1c4e93d5580be0ee1bbe2cddb4e005993c2", "ja": "一期一会……？", "zh": "一生一次的相逢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "daecda5f5012774b1976a0de4dd114854c4e81a3c7a0cb774832d806633018fc", "ja": "うん。今日来てくれるお客さんは、新年最初の時間を\nのり子と一緒に過ごそうとしてくれる人達だから……。", "zh": "嗯，因为今天来场的观众，都是愿意与法子\n一起度过新年最初时刻的人们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "08685bc9404f2341c6ee3c502ebc1325398d89f6e10123fb649faf9265819271", "ja": "アイドルとして、今日出会えたファンのみんなと、\nしっかり縁を結んでこなくちゃじゃないかな。", "zh": "身为偶像，不是应该与今天邂逅的粉丝们\n好好缔结缘份吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3eef126d4b5428b49d43abe989b26247fddeca9a1469e8346c2e2d4b146932db", "ja": "（……割といい感じに話を着地させたと思うんだけど、\nダメだったかな……）", "zh": "（……我提出的说法应该满有道理的，\n这样还是不行吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "33bd6c20d9207fbe5ac88ab2d46f285bc0837392ad88339c627bd6383138e5d2", "ja": "一期一会の、タッグマッチ……。", "zh": "一生一次的双人交替战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1020_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "5eac6974a20bf1eeb87c58b1b2b640f27d800f2de0b5ab770c57e5ac479bcc2c", "ja": "そっか、そうだよね！　今日はアタシにとっても、\nファンのみんなにとっても、新年最初のライブ！", "zh": "原来如此，说得没错！无论对我还是粉丝们来说，\n今天都是新年第一场演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "b93941257978d97684671bc69606f5f6ffaa21001f87d36203a52a2f384b1637", "ja": "つまりそれって、今夜限りの、二度とない\n一期一会のタッグマッチってことだよね！？", "zh": "也就是说，这场演唱会是仅限今晚、独一无二、\n一生一次的双人交替战对不对！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "90e712ff3b94f76b3771187ff9f4fb52aa269f088c87c48666c8cc0607b89e71", "ja": "縁結びのお守りが導いた、ドリームタッグマッチ！\nそういうことでしょ、{$P$}！", "zh": "这是结缘护身符带来的梦幻双人交替战！\n是这样没错吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1024_p", "source_sha256": "53329d0150774c39c8fe62baa415ad2bcee3883a9f78a809dd5b0044b2618a7d", "ja": "あ、ああ。\n大体そういう事……かな！", "zh": "呃、嗯。\n大致上就是这样吧……应该！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "fb42b49d87fcf44e3feb9957164881c1126462ce582f22c0a3fe970b829b8c5e", "ja": "よし、まかせて！　ファンのみんなとガッチリ\n縁を結んで、最高のツープラトンを決めてくるから！", "zh": "好，那尽管交给我！我会跟粉丝们牢牢地缔结缘份，\n使出最棒的合体技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0094_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e1509325dfab96defd7f4354c38cae266264fb9c563d19daa5b64eb2a11f3f6b", "ja": "（そう言って駆け出していくのり子の背中は、\nいつもより凛々しく見えた。……頑張れ、のり子！）", "zh": "（法子说完后便跑了出去，她的背影看起来\n比平时还要威风凛凛……加油，法子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
